WEBVTT

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:17.620
Akkun, it's nearly time to go.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.660
Um, what are you...

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.450
Is something happening today?

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:11.660
We're going to help out in the shopping
district. I asked Yuzu to tell you.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.000
Oops. I forgot.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.830
President...

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:19.660
Akkun, I'll need your help the whole day.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:23.330
H-Happy to do it!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.330
"Roasted Sweet Potato, Nursing, Mascot"

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.330
  "Japanese &amp; Western           "Yatsuho Liquor"
     Spirits and Foodstuffs"

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.460
So this is the event location.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:32.870
Yes.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:35.910
Tip-toe. Welcome!

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.410
I've been expecting you.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.040
She reeks of alcohol.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.290
Don't work us too hard, okay?

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:45.330
Are we doing something?

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:50.950
Today we're helping with an alcohol festival
called Oktoberfest.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:56.910
An alcohol festival? Is this that Beerfest
thing you mentioned before?

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:01.540
Yup. Though it's still a pretty casual event.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.290
Come on. Let's go inside.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:07.790
There are so many kinds.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.080
My grandpa knew a lot about alcohol.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.950
Well, it just means I have a great selection.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:18.790
And you've been running the store
shrewdly since you succeeded him.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.790
Oh, you're going to make me blush.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.750
Shrewd isn't the impression I get, though.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:33.540
She suggested new residents help out here
so they can get accustomed to the area.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.500
That's just the pretense.
Really I just need help.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.540
We'll go with that.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.830
Okay, you change into your outfit too.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.410
Outfit?

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.290
Here it is.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.290
I half expected this, but really?

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:57.500
The new residents are always girls,
so this is all I have.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.750
You're cute enough to pull it off,
so don't worry!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:04.250
Is not wearing it not an option?

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.040
Oh, right.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:10.540
You'll probably need this.
When the time comes you'll know.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.870
Yuri gave me a bag.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:17.330
I bet it has a boy outfit in it!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.500
Nope.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.200
Akkun, that looks good on you.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.830
Yep. Very cute.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:31.000
It's kind of chilly.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:36.290
Listen up! Oktoberfest is a German festival.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.500
You're in...

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.700
...Germany!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.620
That's a bit of a stretch.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:49.120
All right! We're officially open!

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.580
  "Japanese &amp; Western           "Yatsuho Liquor"
     Spirits and Foodstuffs"

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.040
You open?

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.450
We're back again.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:57.910
Welcome!

00:04:57.910 --> 00:04:59.790
Welcome to the store.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.290
There are already customers?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:07.330
The event really started flourishing
once Ayaka started helping.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.370
I think I know why.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.580
I'm ready to order!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.160
C-Coming!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.540
There you go. First task.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.370
Um... Uh...

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.870
This one and this one, please.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:26.040
Um... Uh...

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.000
Let me take a look.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:36.790
Schöfferhofer Weizen, Paulaner
Oktoberfest Bier, and boiled weißwurst.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.200
Got it!

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.620
Wow!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.790
You'll get the hang of it soon, Akkun.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:45.250
R-Right.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.120
"Love Comedy, Tanukizaka, Virgin, Hunter Spirit"

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.330
Take these out.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.330
Okay.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.040
Surprisingly heavy.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.080
You know the World Championship
is coming up.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:03.750
Here are your--

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:06.000
There's that half lightweight girl entering
alongside her brother.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.000
Behind you.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.250
Here are your drinks.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:08.750
She's gonna kick butt.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.950
She can carry that many?

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:09.950
Brother and sister--it's amazing.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.120
Here are your drin--

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.120
Yeah.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.500
Whoa!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.500
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.580
Don't worry about it.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:22.500
Getting a spill from a cute girl
like you is practically a treat.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.080
You're so weird, dear.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.540
Did any get on your clothes?

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.660
I'll wipe it up.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:35.700
Here are two fresh glasses,
and your food is on the house.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.450
You basically did me a favor, little lady.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.160
Don't mind him. He's a bonehead.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.540
Hey!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:46.830
I caused trouble for Miss Caretaker again.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:51.120
I knew I couldn't do this.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:58.790
Everyone makes mistakes.
I'll be here to help you, so don't worry.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.870
Turn your frown upside down.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.000
I'll do my best!

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:11.250
"Oktoberfest"
"Free Admission"

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.950
  "Japanese &amp; Western           "Yatsuho Liquor"
     Spirits and Foodstuffs"

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:30.950
Good work!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.450
You really saved my bacon.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.620
She's drinking again.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:41.080
You made a great waitress babe.
You should be my mascot.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:46.160
I only dressed like this because I'd be
embarrassed if someone I knew saw me.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:50.580
Akkun, you're such a good boy.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.620
You were cool today.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.660
You gave Miss Caretaker alcohol, didn't you?!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.290
I had to. She worked so hard.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:08.200
Akkun, you were cool today.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.200
Ms. Yatsuho!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.540
Miss Caretaker, that's dangerous.
You're in my bubble.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.950
"Sunohara House"

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:28.750
"Field Trip Itinerary"

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:28.750
Kyoto and Nara should be lovely
this time of year.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.910
No funny business just because
we won't be here.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.910
Funny business?

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.950
Have fun on your trip.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.830
We will. See you later.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.910
Think I'll get some good pictures?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.660
I wanna see the big Buddha.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:48.500
President, do you have everything you need?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.790
I do.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.120
Let's see lots of temples, too.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.120
Yes.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.080
There they go.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.450
Yep.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:09:00.370
It's going to be lonely
around here without them.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.370
Should we sleep together tonight?

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.950
N-No need!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.330
Guess I'll start with breakfast cleanup.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:24.160
I wonder what Yuzu and the others
are up to in Kyoto.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.660
Oh, it's gotten cold.

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.080
Sis!

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.000
I'm here to visit.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.750
Oh, welcome home, Nana.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:39.200
What is there to eat? I'm hungry.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.500
Okay. What would you like?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.500
Something hot!

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.790
Something hot...

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.290
I have just the thing.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.450
Here you go.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.200
Thank you.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:02.120
Roasted sweet potato! Time to chow down.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.830
It's so sweet and good.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.910
Yum!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.370
Glad you like it.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:12.290
It's fun to have these in the back yard.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.120
Yes.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:18.200
Are Yucchi and the gang on their field trip?
This is way better!

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.160
I wouldn't go that far.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.870
Let's send them a picture!

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.870
It's from Nana- <i>sempai</i> .

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.620
What'd she say?

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:36.910
Sweet potato?

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:38.950
What are they doing?

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.700
Oh, it's from Yucchi.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.040
Those <i>dango</i> look good, too.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.620
They seem to be having fun.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.750
They sure are eating a lot.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:11:00.080
We have lots more where that came from.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.200
If I have that many I'll get fat!

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:08.580
You'll be in trouble too, Sis, if you try to
keep up with kids in their growth period.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:14.040
My job as caretaker is pretty strenuous, so...

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.870
She glossed over it.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:23.540
It's nice to eat outside,
but maybe it's time to go in.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.200
Yeah.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:30.080
My legs are super cold! Sis, can I use the bath?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.410
Want to use it together?

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:33.290
For real?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:33.910
Yes.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.870
"Bath in Use"

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:43.580
I knew I'd been pretty lax lately, but this...

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:48.450
I did think you were hiding
something with your clothes.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:50.040
You noticed?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.000
I <i>am</i> your sister.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.750
Then why did you give me something as
high-calorie as roasted sweet potato?

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.620
Didn't you like it?

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.620
Well, yes, but...

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:06.410
I just wanted to give you something you
don't get to have very often.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.450
Let me see <i>your</i> body!

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:11.750
Oh, my.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.830
You're stylish like always, Sis. I'm jealous.

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.200
What's this?

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.580
Hey, Nana.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.620
Sis!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.330
At this rate, you're gonna be in trouble!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:39.500
Y-Your face looks like trouble.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.910
In trouble!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:47.080
Trouble. Trouble. Trouble.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.080
Nana!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.700
What are they <i>doing</i> ?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.200
What are <i>they</i> doing?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:01.620
"Sunohara House"

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.040
Bye now. See you soon.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.620
Take care.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:14.000
Nana already left.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.660
Could it be a thief?

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.290
I have to protect Miss Caretaker!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:31.370
Maybe I am in trouble like Nana said.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.910
Hmm. Which button is it?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.290
Huh? What? What happened?

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.580
I was never here.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:45.040
Fall is the season for exercise, after all.

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:48.330
We're home!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.450
Miss Caretaker!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:23.160
I appreciate you always waking me up,
but couldn't you do it more norm--

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:28.500
Akkun... It's... morning.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.540
Miss Caretaker?

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.330
President!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.120
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What is it?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:45.950
M-M-M-Miss Caretaker! Miss Caretaker
collapsed...and, um...she...

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:47.950
A-Ambulance!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.290
F-For now just calm down.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.500
Then get out of my room.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.250
She's gonna make it, right?

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.040
That's overboard. You're totally freaking out.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:12.750
You were making such a fuss I thought
it was serious, but this is probably a cold.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:16.540
Hmm. She <i>was</i> exercising lightly dressed.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.450
That must be why.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.790
More importantly...

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:25.750
Where's my apology for barging
into my room without even knocking?

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:28.120
I'm sowwy.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:34.450
We can't force her to move, so I guess we'll
have her rest in your room for now.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.580
I brought Ayaka's pajamas.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:43.120
She'll probably sweat a lot,
so I brought a spare set and a towel.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:47.120
Thanks. Okay, let's get her changed.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.370
Sumire, Yuri, lend me a hand.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.250
Get out of here.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:11.200
Hey, Shiina, the rest is up to you.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.620
Huh?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:16.160
We have student council business today.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.370
We need you to nurse Ayaka back to health.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.120
I'll inform the school.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:29.200
I'm reluctant to leave the two of you alone.
You're up to the task?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.660
Y-Yes!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:40.870
I just sounded like a strong,
capable senior. So cool.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.950
Piping hot stew.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:55.160
And we're going to feed it to you.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.450
Why are you being cruel?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:04.330
Yuzu, Akkun, please rethink your actions.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.580
Hot!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.870
A dream?

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:20.410
I'm... in Akkun's room?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:25.500
Everyone must be at school.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.120
Akkun.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.410
Oh, Miss Caretaker!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:35.580
You're awake! I made you some <i>okayu</i> .

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.410
Y-You heard me?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.500
What?

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:42.620
What about school?

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.790
You can't just skip classes.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:50.120
The President's got the school handled.

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:57.290
Besides, I can't leave you alone in this
condition, Miss Caretaker. You need rest.

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:01.450
You can rely on me for the whole day!

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:04.950
Who can rely on a naughty child
who skips school?

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.620
But I...

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:13.700
It's just a joke. I'm grateful to have you.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:18.120
So will you help me with my <i>okayu</i> ?

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.950
S-Sure.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.330
Here you go.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.830
Ahhhhhhh.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.950
Ahhh?

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.540
Ahhhhhhh.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.750
Ahhhhhhh.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.200
Why am <i>I</i> embarrassed?

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:49.540
That was wonderful.

00:18:55.410 --> 00:19:02.000
You're drenched! Better get changed.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.830
Sorry! I'll be in the hall!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.160
Oh, please wait.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.290
Huh?

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:13.500
Could you...wipe my back?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.500
Y-Your back?

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.500
You don't have to, of course.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.040
I'll do it.

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:23.620
Then let's get to it.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.790
W-Wait, wait!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.700
Oh, you need a towel?

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:33.410
That's not the problem!
You can't be that out of it!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:37.290
Stay facing that way. Got it?

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:39.500
I shouldn't have to tell you that.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.580
Understood.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.290
Calm down. Stay cool.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.290
This is nursing.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:01.120
Keep it together. Keep it together.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:07.700
Keep it together. Keep it together.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:13.620
Um, could you get another spot?

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:22.870
I'll hold them up, so could you wipe here too?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:29.370
It would really make me feel better if you did.

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.160
Understood.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:38.410
That's right. This is nursing!

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:43.000
If I don't, then who will...

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.620
Help her!

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:02.000
Thank you so much.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.870
Y-You're welcome.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.700
Good Morrrning!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:15.790
Sorry for causing you trouble,
but thanks to all of you I'm all better!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.290
Akkun, you were a great help, too.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.660
It was nothing.

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:23.160
You didn't use the chaos to do
any funny stuff, did you?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.620
Shiina.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:25.830
What happened?

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:28.160
Nothing happened!

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:30.290
I always--

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:36.660
Oh, no! You caught my cold.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:40.790
No, it was just dust.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:47.370
If you get a fever, then <i>I'll</i>
wipe <i>you</i> all over, okay?

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:50.580
<i>She'll</i> ?

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.950
Wipe <i>you</i> ?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.870
All over?

00:21:55.540 --> 00:22:01.700
All right! Better get to school early
to make up for yesterday!

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:42.000
"Costumes, Penguins, Playing Big Sister"

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:46.950
"Thanks for watching."
"Ouch. I tripped!"
